	<#bbbbbb>Health: 1500</>
	<#bbbbbb>This move list assumes you are facing to the right.</>
	<#790909>UNIQUE TRAIT: EXPLOSIVE RAGE</>
	Angous has a powered-up form that he can access by using his
	EXPLOSIVE RAGE super. This form increases his speed and power, while
	also giving him access to new moves. Moves that can only be used
	in this form are marked with (RAGE).

	<#790909>UNIQUE MOVES</>
PRIMAL	-		_F^C
WORLD DESTROYER	-		(CAN BE HELD) _DF^C
   <#bbbbbb>Has armor while charging and becomes unblockable when fully held.</>
MOVE THE GROUND	-		(HOLD)_D^C
   <#bbbbbb>Can be used after landing _D^C. Has armor.</>









